                with an invented number in it. Five specialist agents run behind a <strong>grounding gate</strong> that verifies every claim's quote against its source in code before it can be cited — a
                hallucinated figure becomes a dropped claim, never a line in the brief. A dedicated <strong>Contrarian</strong> agent may only attack, and change between runs is <strong>computed by diffing findings</strong>, never narrated by the model. Reasoning is
